
NinaivuKalanjiyam (நினைவுகளஞ்சியம்)

This is a web-based project that converts speech into text (Speech-to-Text) and generates stories.

Technologies (Tech Stack)

- Frontend: React.js
- Backend: Node.js
- Database: PostgreSQL

How to Run the Project (Setup Instructions)

1. Download (clone) the project to your computer.
2. Go into the "frontend" and "backend" folders and run "npm install" to install the required packages.
3. Run "npm start" to start the project.
